  <RimTalk.Memory.UI.TabWindow.Guide>=== Memory Archive Workbench Guide ===

[Layout]
- Top: pawn selector, filters and tools menu
- Top-left: life chronicle navigation (CLPA)
- Bottom-left: vertical timeline (ABM/SCM/ELS)
- Right: memory details and editing

[Controls]
- Click a card to focus; Ctrl for multi-select; drag on empty space to box-select
- Scroll wheel scrolls the timeline, pans the chronicle, zooms the chronicle axis
- Dragging the chronicle cursor repositions the timeline
- Drag the splitter to resize timeline vs. details
</RimTalk.Memory.UI.TabWindow.Guide>
